c2 = Categorical.from_codes([0, 1], categories=['a', 'b'])

result_eq = c1 == c2
result_ne = c1!= c2

print(result_eq)  # Should print [False, False]
print(result_ne)  # Should print [True, True]
```
These tests demonstrate how the function handles comparisons involving NaN values, ensuring that the comparison results are correct and consistent with the expected behavior of pandas.

